        "slc_0f39990907edfcf355758430a0c05410f2b67b36e92b78cef2d7942eb843787c"
      ],
      "text": "Execution is built from agents (sub-roles like impl, test, commit-msg, title, oversight), flows composing agents into pipelines, tasks that pick a flow, and scheduled routines."
    },
